---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy | GlobalsBlog"
	description="Read the Privacy Policy for GlobalsBlog, including how visitor information may be collected and used."
>
	<section class="content-page">
		<div class="content-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
			<h1>How GlobalsBlog handles visitor information.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				This Privacy Policy explains the types of information that may be collected when users
				visit GlobalsBlog and how that information may be used to operate, improve, and protect
				the website.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="content-grid">
			<article class="content-card">
				<h2>Information we may collect</h2>
				<p>
					GlobalsBlog may collect non-personal information such as browser type, device
					information, referring pages, and general usage data. If a visitor contacts us by
					email, we may also receive the information included in that message.
				</p>

				<h2>How information may be used</h2>
				<ul class="content-list">
					<li>To maintain and improve website performance and usability</li>
					<li>To respond to messages, questions, or business inquiries</li>
					<li>To monitor traffic and understand how visitors use the site</li>
					<li>To help detect spam, abuse, or technical issues</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
				<p>
					GlobalsBlog may use cookies or similar technologies to support analytics, essential
					site functions, and advertising services such as Google AdSense. Third-party vendors
					may use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this or other websites.
				</p>

				<h2>Third-party services</h2>
				<p>
					We may use third-party tools for analytics, content delivery, hosting, or advertising.
					Those providers may process data according to their own privacy policies.
				</p>
			</article>

			<aside class="content-card content-card-accent">
				<h2>Your choices</h2>
				<p>
					Visitors can control cookies through their browser settings. If you contact us and
					want your email or message reviewed for removal where reasonably possible, reach us at
					<a href="mailto:contact@globalsblog.com">contact@globalsblog.com</a>.
				</p>

				<h2>Contact</h2>
				<p>
					GlobalsBlog<br />
					Sector 48, Gurugram, Haryana, India<br />
					<a href="mailto:contact@globalsblog.com">contact@globalsblog.com</a>
				</p>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
